type: text
aliases: ban, bans, hypixel, ac

---

Geyser does not perfectly replicate a Java client. An anticheat can pick up irregular behavior from Geyser and trigger an event from the anticheat. For personal servers, not all anticheats will work properly with Geyser. Please take a look at our [anticheat compatibility page](https://geysermc.org/wiki/geyser/anticheat-compatibility/). 

Also, please exercise caution when going on large servers, **especially Hypixel**, since they can pick up irregular behavior from Geyser and ban you. 
